      "category": "team",
      "content": "@pentestor reported an issue where a filter that prevents the usage of [1-9] and [a-z] characters in the `subdomain` parameter can be bypassed by utilizing a non-Latin domain. The report demonstrates the exploitation of this vulnerability by redirecting to the `नमस्ते.भारत` domain.\nThe issue has been addressed.\n",
